  "enable": "Set H5-01 node address (default 1FH), H5-02 speed (default 3 = 9600 bps) and H5-03 parity (default 0 = none), then cycle power. For Modbus control set b1-01 = 2 and b1-02 = 2; H5-12 selects how 0001H bits 0/1 are read.",
  "watchdog": "H5-05 = 1 (default) enables CE detection after H5-09 (default 2.0 s, 0.0-10.0 s) without traffic; H5-04 selects the reaction (0 ramp, 1 coast, 2 fast stop, 3 alarm only - default). 002CH bit F flags the timeout.",
  "quirks": [
   "Hex 0-based registers.",
   "No function 06H.",
   "Parameter writes need the Enter command unless H5-11 = 1."
  ],
  "setup": [
   "RS-422/485 on terminals R+, R-, S+, S-; 8 data bits and 1 stop bit are fixed.",
   "Use DIP switch S2 to switch on the termination resistor at the last drive.",
   "H5-07 RTS control defaults to enabled."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "H5-01 = 0 makes the drive ignore Modbus.",
   "H5 changes need a power cycle on this drive."
  ]
